{
  "id": "trolley_passenger",
  "cityId": "vinnytsia",
  "npcId": "npc_passenger",
  "zone": "trolleybus",
  "inkContent": {
    "en": {
      "inkVersion": 21,
      "root": [
        [
          "\n",
          "^First time in Vinnytsia? You keep looking around. ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:npc_passenger",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Так, перший раз. (Yes, first time.)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-0",
            "flg": 20
          },
          "ev",
          "str",
          "^Так. А куди ми їдемо? (Yes. Where are we going?)",
          "/str",
          "/ev",
          {
            "*": "0.c-1",
            "flg": 20
          },
          {
            "c-0": [
              "\n",
              "^Look out of the window then. See the tram, «трамвай»? Our trams used to run in Switzerland.",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "c-1": [
              "\n",
              "^Downtown, to Soborna, our main street, «головна вулиця».",
              "\n",
              {
                "->": "0.g-0"
              },
              {
                "#f": 5
              }
            ],
            "g-0": [
              "^Oh, an announcement, listen!",
              "\n",
              "^«Увага! Наступна зупинка: Центральний парк.» You need Soborna. What do you do? ",
              "#",
              "^quiz:trolley_stop_1",
              "/#",
              "\n",
              "ev",
              {
                "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
              },
              "/ev",
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b",
                  "c": true
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^Right, stay seated. Yours is the next one. And here's Soborna!",
                    "\n",
                    "ev",
                    true,
                    "/ev",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "stop_ok",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-0.12"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "->": ".^.b"
                },
                {
                  "b": [
                    "\n",
                    "^You got off?.. No worries, you can walk to the centre through the park!",
                    "\n",
                    "ev",
                    false,
                    "/ev",
                    {
                      "VAR=": "stop_ok",
                      "re": true
                    },
                    {
                      "->": "0.g-0.12"
                    },
                    null
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "nop",
              "\n",
              "end",
              [
                "done",
                {
                  "#n": "g-1"
                }
              ],
              null
            ]
          }
        ],
        "done",
        {
          "global decl": [
            "ev",
            0,
            {
              "VAR=": "trust"
            },
            false,
            {
              "VAR=": "quiz_ok"
